# Glowvia Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local to connect to your live Supabase project

# 1. Sign up at https://supabase.com and create a new project.
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API to copy your Project URL and Anon Public Key.
# 3. Paste them below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Leave these as placeholders to explore the local sample-data demo.
# Demo identities are not real accounts or secure administrator authorization.
# Live order creation remains disabled until trusted server-side order logic exists.

